# L §4.4's list (tally 2.3, #247; the planner's pin table, window wd 2026-11-02 to 2026-11-09, a Monday to the
# next): year_of, quarter_of, month_of, age, age_months, overlap_days give the value every combination of ends
# gives, `none` too; days_between, dcf and weekday are off the list, the hole (weekday is 1 at both ends and 4
# inside). Before: ranges of numbers, a weekday 1..7, and `none` on part of a window the hole.
=== m.tally
model wd
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source card "invented"
input w: date
input d0: date
input d1: date
input b0: date
input k: month
input n1: int
input n4: int
input n12: int
input n30: int
input nm1: int
input nm40: int
version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  w = window(2026-11-02, 2026-11-09) "c"
  d0 = 2024-02-29 "c"
  d1 = 2025-02-28 "c"
  b0 = 2020-02-29 "c"
  k = 2024-02 "c"
  n1 = 1 "c"
  n4 = 4 "c"
  n12 = 12 "c"
  n30 = 30 "c"
  nm1 = -1 "c"
  nm40 = -40 "c"
ask r16: year_of(w)
ask r17: quarter_of(w)
ask r18: month_of(w)
ask r19: age(w, d1)
ask r20: age(b0, w)
ask r21: age_months(w, d1)
ask r21_p20261102: age_months(w, d1) with w = 2026-11-02
ask r21_p20261109: age_months(w, d1) with w = 2026-11-09
ask r22: age_months(b0, w)
ask r23: days_between(w, d0)
ask r25: overlap_days(w, d1, k)
ask r26: overlap_days(b0, w, k)
ask r27: dcf(w, d1, act365)
ask r29: weekday(w)
ask r29_p20261102: weekday(w) with w = 2026-11-02
ask r29_p20261105: weekday(w) with w = 2026-11-05
ask r29_p20261109: weekday(w) with w = 2026-11-09
ask r32: start_of(month_of(w))
=== expect
r16: 2026
  cut 2026-01-01
r17: 2026-Q4
  cut 2026-01-01
r18: 2026-11
  cut 2026-01-01
r19: none
  cut 2026-01-01
r20: 6
  cut 2026-01-01
r21: none
  cut 2026-01-01
r21_p20261102: none
  pinned: w = 2026-11-02
  cut 2026-01-01
r21_p20261109: none
  pinned: w = 2026-11-09
  cut 2026-01-01
r22: 80
  cut 2026-01-01
r23: ?"date within window(2026-11-02, 2026-11-09) not precise enough for days_between" (w)
  unknown day: w
  cut 2026-01-01
r25: 0
  cut 2026-01-01
r26: 29
  cut 2026-01-01
r27: ?"date within window(2026-11-02, 2026-11-09) not precise enough for dcf" (w)
  unknown day: w
  cut 2026-01-01
r29: ?"date within window(2026-11-02, 2026-11-09) not precise enough for weekday" (w)
  unknown day: w
  cut 2026-01-01
r29_p20261102: 1
  pinned: w = 2026-11-02
  cut 2026-01-01
r29_p20261105: 4
  pinned: w = 2026-11-05
  cut 2026-01-01
r29_p20261109: 1
  pinned: w = 2026-11-09
  cut 2026-01-01
r32: 2026-11-01
  cut 2026-01-01
warning: WARN-UNREAD input n1 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input n12 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input n30 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input n4 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input nm1 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input nm40 is read by nothing
